1. hpke-x25519-sha256-chacha20poly1305-base.json
------------------------------------------------

Copied from https://github.com/cfrg/draft-irtf-cfrg-hpke
(commit b1f7cb0cdeab6906c61b3d6574e8bdfdbe1cd3fb, file test-vectors.json).

These are the RFC 9180 Appendix A test vectors (RFC 9180, "Hybrid Public Key Encryption",
R. Barnes, K. Bhargavan, B. Lipp, C. Wood, February 2022). Credit belongs to the RFC's authors and
the contributors to that repository.

Changed: the file is filtered to the single vector with mode = 0, kem_id = 32, kdf_id = 1 and
aead_id = 3 (RFC 9180 Appendix A.2.1) and re-serialised as JSON. Every value is unchanged.

